=== P3c steering-scale calibration, written before running: P3b final nets 2400, 2402, 2403, 2404, 2405 (usable), point 3600, all arms; scales 1, 2, 4 (multiples of the probe-induced displacement)
Selection rule (fixed before any result): the largest scale at which, in PFATE (median over the five nets),
  (a) the symmetric random-direction effect (mean of the + and - random effects) is at most 0.05 in absolute value on A and on C, and
  (b) the lowest correct-given-report rate on steered clear trials, over all steering runs, is at least 0.9 on A and on C.
If no scale meets both, scale 1. The summary is blind: no directional, cross or direction-geometry measure is computed or printed.
